{"authorDailyContributionsMap":{"currycurry11":[{"date":"2026-09-29T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"8e7fc22129dc3d395627e0e69ad7460cb9ce37e8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Joshua\u0027s detail to AboutUs","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"0bb7d8623a77accca39a634385a3168d7f8fb411","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #28 from currycurry11/branch-update-details","messageBody":"Add Joshua\u0027s detail to AboutUs","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"05dbe0e387bf3f91e9bd91d541ee8af90b78ef4a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Developer Guide: Add use cases","messageBody":"The developer guide lacks a structured description of the application\u0027s functional requirements.\\n\\nAdd ten PawPals use cases covering client, pet, appointment, search, help, data-clearing, exit, and automatic-save behavior. Include main success scenarios, preconditions, and extensions so the requirements are clear without exposing implementation details.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":241,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"7112b29359f4ae563f16f56c375861b6682bcd60","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Revert \"Developer Guide: Add use cases\"","messageBody":"This reverts commit 05dbe0e387bf3f91e9bd91d541ee8af90b78ef4a.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":0,"deletions":241}}},{"hash":"cb320f55e696c9227bffb8cd56f0136b160e55a3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Developer Guide: Refine use case section","messageBody":"The use cases belong under Appendix: Requirements immediately after the user stories.\\n\\nReplace the placeholder delete-person example with the ten PawPals use cases in the original guide location. Preserve the structured main success scenarios, preconditions, and extensions while keeping the design and implementation sections unchanged.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":225,"deletions":15}}},{"hash":"9275243ca0dfc68abd678451c74c2ea2ab5610f4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Developer Guide: Generalize use case steps","messageBody":"The use cases describe user goals, but several steps expose CLI command names and command-format terminology.\\n\\nRewrite those steps and error flows in terms of user intent and observable application behavior so the use cases remain independent of the interface implementation.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":20,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"eba60a7f0cd0868c65479dcc2071a41683138cf8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Developer Guide: Simplify use case flows","messageBody":"The use case flows include unnecessary system prompts and extension branches that contradict their preconditions.\\n\\nSimplify the add-client flow to capture the user\u0027s request and input directly, and remove redundant missing-client extensions from the add-pet and add-appointment use cases. Update extension numbering to match the revised flows.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":7,"deletions":14}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-06T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e143e5cc7117e7d43c162d3e812f6b8b43f7c175","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #52 from isaacser8/49-add-breed","messageBody":"Add Breed model","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"fbb0d347e7906ce52db5f237ee939e913ef581f7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #51 from isaacser8/48-add-species","messageBody":"Add Species model","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"0243817041a4a02cd700580e03604bc8ae00ccca","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #47 from isaacser8/46-add-pet-name","messageBody":"Add PetName model","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-07T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"fe2141b5da5401768b442c8c8700216a9d3f6117","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #53 from isaacser8/50-add-pet-model","messageBody":"Add basic Pet m